Cell["\<\
Five, six and seven triangles about a vertex: on the sphere, in the plane and \
in the hyperbolic plane. The curvature is 1/6, 0 and \[Minus]1/6, an angle \
defect of \[Pi]/3, 0 and \[Minus]\[Pi]/3.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"93e39e21-5f96-443e-99b7-e0cdcd43704f"],

