Cell["\<\
The uniform tilings of the plane are flat: the trihexagonal tiling {3, 6, 3, \
6}, the truncated trihexagonal tiling {4, 6, 12} and the truncated hexagonal \
tiling {3, 12, 12}.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"13897f44-e6f0-4b80-a9b9-fc1354085e7a"],

