Cell["\<\
On a closed map in which every vertex looks alike, the number of vertices \
times the curvature is the Euler characteristic: the cube, the icosahedron, a \
square torus and the Klein quartic.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"d1676b58-5b35-4811-a560-134cb15e22ec"],

