Cell["\<\
A map with faces of several sizes needs its configuration: the cuboctahedron \
has two triangles and two squares at every vertex, curvature 1/6, but its \
girth 3 and degree 4 read as four triangles, 1/3.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"e5e1c18c-7b76-4168-af30-6e5b6008cae9"],

