Cell["\<\
On a small torus a cycle round the torus can be shorter than a face. The 3 \
\[Times] 3 square torus has girth 3, and the graph form reads it as curved.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"eb7ff641-6169-4644-8be2-e8342dfafc0f"],

